    <bpmn:process id="W_W2554" name="W2554. Product Authentication Data Platform Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Platform maintenance cycle or system update
Frequency: Monthly maintenance; quarterly feature updates
Volume: 1 platform managing 500K+ serial records
Owner: IT Data Architect
Participants: IT Data Architect, LP Manager, IT Operations
Source: workflow W2554 — Product Authentication Data Platform Management</bpmn:documentation>
