      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2554_Task4" name="IT maintains authentication data platform: serial number database, vendor ASN…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT maintains authentication data platform: serial number database, vendor ASN integration APIs, QR code generation engine, scan analytics, reference image library; ensures data integrity with daily reconciliation against inventory records
Responsible (R): IT Data Architect
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2554_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2554_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2554_Task5" name="IT implements platform enhancements: batch QR code generation for faster GR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT implements platform enhancements: batch QR code generation for faster GR processing, mobile app integration for in-store verification by staff, vendor self-service portal for ASN submission, machine learning model for counterfeit pattern detection
Responsible (R): IT Data Architect
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Quarterly releases</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2554_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2554_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2554_Task6" name="IT manages data lifecycle: archives sold/expired product serial records…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IT manages data lifecycle: archives sold/expired product serial records (10-year retention per BIR), purges invalid scan data, maintains platform performance targets (&lt;3 sec scan response), manages database capacity growth (~2,000–3,000 new serials/month per W2550; ~500K+ records accumulated over the 10-year BIR retention window)
Responsible (R): IT Data Architect / IT Ops
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2554_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2554_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2554_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2554_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
