        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-442 (ensure controlled execution — Product Authentication &amp; Serialization (PA-71.1).) | - operational: Category Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
